WEBVTT

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:21.090
If there is a rampaging monster, I will eat it up!

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.930
If there is a shining treasure, I will eat it up!

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:26.360
A bold and amazing performance!

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.310
Victory is for me!

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:44.340
Get them right, yeah

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:17.890
I'm not going to do it!

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:18.890
I'm not going to kill you!

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:26.660
I'm not going to kill you!

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.660
I'm not going to kill you!

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:28.640
Oh?

00:02:30.570 --> 00:03:00.000
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:06.300
Tohzokkiller's Rina Inverse!

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:20.540
With the help of Rina Inverse, the warrior and her mage,

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:25.370
the evil Tohzokkiller has been destroyed and one evil is destroyed.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:29.640
However, as long as evil exists in this world, Rina's battle...

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:36.210
Hey, Rina. Don't lose, Rina!

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:44.960
Rina, the slave of anger.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:55.520
I was chased.

00:03:55.520 --> 00:04:00.000
I just gave him a little treasure, but he didn't give it to me.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.890
They are persistently, persistently, persistently chasing us.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.890
It looks like they're surrounded.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:12.480
We've caught up with eight of them.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:13.640
Miss.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:17.100
How dare you make us all into moss!

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.100
Ah! Jyo-chan!

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:21.060
That's such a stupid line.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.040
Hey, old man.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:26.040
I'll make sure to get rid of them before this year ends.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:30.000
To be honest, I don't want to be with you.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.630
I don't want to fight with you.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:35.790
W-w-w-wait a minute!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.370
Anyway, if we do it properly,

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:41.410
I think I'll be able to see quite a lot of pain.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:44.520
Yeah, you don't seem to be a fool.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.930
You're a big ball.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:50.530
Well, it's Jo-chan, so I don't have a ball, but...

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:52.530
What a mean guy.

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:55.360
Well, there's no one more elegant than him.

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:56.360
Hm?

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.490
That hand...

00:04:58.490 --> 00:04:59.500
Marukishi Kuro...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.160
That's right.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.160
He suddenly used a flashy spell to kick us out of here.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:06.760
The boss was also turned into a firework and fell.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:10.660
If you notice, the blind treasure is gone.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:14.110
We won't go that far either.

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:16.260
The villain has no human rights.

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:18.250
What?

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:22.490
So, it's supposed to be the boss' revenge.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:26.490
It's a line to chase you until you kill you.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:28.970
What on earth do you want to say?

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.000
How about it?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.340
Don't you want to join the Dragon's Wings?

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:34.480
The Dragon's Wings?

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.880
I'm not joking!

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:38.100
I can bend!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.830
If you're going to return the treasure and become our friend,

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:45.150
you can pour it all into the water, right?

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.320
It's not a bad story, is it?

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.470
I'm not as bad as a thief.

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:53.970
I can't answer that strong will.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.480
Who is an old man like you?

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:59.320
Men are limited to the prince on the grave.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:06.870
If you get out of here, you're going to get caught and you're going to have to prepare for it!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.520
That's the kind of line I like.

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:20.780
You guys, come here!

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:25.680
That's all? That's not enough, is it?

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:27.100
It's not just this!

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:30.000
In the forest, our friends are my shadow!

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:35.920
Your body is shaking, so if you want to apologize with your hands, you can save your life.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:40.030
Don't underestimate the dragon's fangs.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.270
Wait a minute!

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:53.280
How long are you going to leave it like this?

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:57.760
You little thugs, roll your tails and run away.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:00.000
If you do that, I'll save your life.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.900
Shut up! Who the hell are you?!

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:08.000
I don't have a name to call you.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.860
What?!

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.860
It seems that Namiko Matatsuki is here again.

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:16.860
Shut up! Then I'll get rid of you!

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:21.350
Do it!

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:36.640
In this case, the heroine is running around while saying, "Kya! Kya!"

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.960
I think that's the right way to do it!

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:52.160
Help me!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:16.000
Are you okay?

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:22.030
Yes!

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:24.740
I'm obsessed with my beauty.

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:26.040
It's impossible.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.240
I'm confident in my appearance.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.000
My small eyes,

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.730
What a pretty face. I want to protect men without thinking about it.

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:34.610
Clean and graceful body with a small body.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.020
It's a simple sigh.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.190
What is it? Is it a child?

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:51.680
I thought she was a little better woman in this situation, but isn't she a little kid with plump eyes?

00:08:53.850 --> 00:09:00.000
She is a little shorter than girls of the same age, and her chest is a little tight.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:03.760
That's what I care about the most.

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:06.980
Even though I tried my best to put on some powder on my body.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:12.450
It's unfortunate that you have ears that are better than ordinary people.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.880
I'm sure you're whispering so that I can't hear you.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.460
I'm not with you today.

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:19.600
Oh, my God.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:23.650
It wasn't really dangerous, but I have to know that much.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:27.770
Even if it looks like this, I grew up with strict etiquette.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:30.000
Oh, my God, it's dangerous.

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:35.310
No, it's not like I have to thank you again.

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:36.770
Hahaha.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:39.330
Ah, more importantly, are you not hurt, miss?

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:41.450
Oh, miss?

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:44.150
It's dangerous for a girl to walk alone.

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:47.090
I wonder if your father or someone else is with you?

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:48.040
Katsu-kun...

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.500
No! Well, I'm alone!

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.060
That's a bit scary.

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:54.770
Alright, I'll send you home.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:56.170
So, where's your home?

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:57.070
Well...

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:57.970
Over there?

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.000
Wait a minute!

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:08.790
Well, I was thinking of going to Atlas City for the time being, but I can't believe it.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.620
I see. Yeah, that's right.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.740
It's hard for you too.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:16.650
What?

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.630
No, I know. I know.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.630
There must have been a lot of things.

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:22.630
No, I'm not...

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:24.630
You don't have to say anything. I know.

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:30.000
You know, I just wanted to look around the world.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:34.220
I'll follow you all the way to Atlas City!

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:35.530
Oi oi oi!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.980
I understand.

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:38.930
You need a friend.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:43.010
To go all the way to Atlas City...

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:46.430
If I keep hanging out with this haggard big brother,

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:49.910
I'll be stressed out until I get to Atlas City.

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:53.390
Alright, let's go once we're done talking.

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:56.340
There's no such thing as "finally done".

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.190
You haven't introduced yourself yet, have you?

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.000
I'm Gowrie.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.980
As you can see, he is a traveller and a mercenary.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:04.390
So...

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.810
Well, whatever.

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:09.000
I don't think he has any ulterior motives.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:12.740
He seems to be seriously worried about me.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:16.390
Come on, young lady.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:19.010
Let's have lunch with the children in the next village.

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:22.500
If we go out with them, we'll be stressed out.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:27.090
That's right, I forgot to tell you.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:27.910
Young lady!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:28.740
What's your name?

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:35.000
My name is Rina Inba!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:54.110
I'll treat you to anything you like.

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:57.150
Really?

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.330
Everything!

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.000
Everything?

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:02.790
This is... this and this and this and this...

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:03.970
Each 3 pieces!

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.290
3 pieces each!?

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:08.440
*BOOM*

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.120
*BOOM*

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:14.000
*BOOM*

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:14.500
*BOOM*

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:56.970
There's still soup left.

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.920
Don't hold back.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.000
That's right.

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.920
I'm hungry, and I'm just like this.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.790
Is that so?

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.270
From your stomach to your chest, you're so flat.

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.210
Did you say something?

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:08.120
No, nothing.

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.220
If you're a traveler...

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:10.630
Hm?

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:13.590
*coughing*

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:15.590
I am...

00:13:15.590 --> 00:13:18.890
the old man of this town, Saman.

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:20.800
Are you...

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:23.510
that famous genius sorcerer,

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:25.770
Lina Inverse-sama?

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:27.170
Eh, well...

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:28.080
What?

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:30.000
You're a sorcerer?

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:37.440
If you look at this outfit, you're bold, aren't you?

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:41.710
I'm either a fish shop or a waitress.

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:46.190
Are you a waitress? What kind of eyes do you have?

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:50.440
Um, can I continue talking?

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:54.960
At a time like this, the drama of that bandit killer,

00:13:54.960 --> 00:14:00.000
I can't believe I'm being framed by Ms. Rina Inverse.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.360
It's quite famous, isn't it?

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:06.400
Wait, I don't mind being a bandit killer, but what's a "dramata"?

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.600
A dragon is also a demon...

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:09.960
WHAT THE HECK?!

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.820
I don't get it. Stop it!

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:16.220
No, I didn't say that. It's just a rumor.

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:18.220
What do you want from me?

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:24.120
Actually, this town has been being targeted by bandits for a while now.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:27.800
Is that the dragon's fangs?

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.000
Yes, do you know that?

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.330
I've already crushed it.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.430
What did you say?

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.730
Yesterday, I beat it by force.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:38.110
The rest was beaten by this guy.

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:40.730
What?

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.220
Oh, are you talking about the guys from earlier?

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:48.760
Oh, I can't believe I can defeat that Black Dragon so easily.

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:49.880
What?

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:53.410
The Black Dragon that that band of bandits was fighting...

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:58.310
The city police force couldn't do anything about it, so I had no choice but to follow their orders.

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:00.000
As expected of...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.200
I'm sorry, Master Inversal...

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:08.050
If only I hadn't let everyone die...

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.170
Did you defeat a dragon?

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.080
I don't know anything like that.

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.020
Then that dragon...

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:16.940
Is it Nobara from now on?

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:18.270
I don't know.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:20.150
What are you going to do?

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:22.270
It doesn't really matter.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:25.950
Do you want to chase after a dragon that you don't even know where it is?

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:26.570
What?

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.390
It's a black dragon!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.000
Black dragon!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:47.070
I didn't say a word about defeating the dragon.

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:50.340
I said I crushed the dragon's fangs.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.200
I-I can't believe it!

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:55.050
You crushed the dragon without defeating it?

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.870
I don't know anything about that.

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.880
N-no way!

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:19.820
What do you think?

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:20.260
Yes!

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:24.640
25 times!

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:25.780
Isn't that great?

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:26.980
Hey, hey!

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.280
I can't help it, I'm about to die!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.260
What's up, Jo-chan?

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:54.000
Big!

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:59.830
The dragon's fangs' parent ball was bought at the Yomise of the Edo period when I was a child.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.950
There's only three of them.

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:06.860
At first, they were as big as my palm, but...

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:11.970
I took good care of them and raised them up to that point.

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:15.540
Even if it's a dragon, it can be loved.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:17.540
You should be impressed!

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:29.430
Oh, it's too late.

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:00.680
But I'm not sure.

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:21.930
The flow of time is more important than the flow of blood.

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:24.290
Hey! Remember that!

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:27.940
In the name of the great Nanji, I swear to the darkness here.

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:30.000
We will stand in front of you.

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:35.880
To all foolish people, I, Nanji, will give you power and equal destruction!

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:38.770
Dragunov!

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:06.530
This is the strongest spell!

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:08.770
Dragslayer's power is...

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:12.680
Don't use such a trick so suddenly!

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:15.110
If the result is good, everything is fine!

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.130
You...

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.780
Is there anything good?

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.520
Don't forget the promised money!

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:26.920
Don't mess with me!

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:28.900
What are you going to do with that?

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:39.740
As for me, Drag Slave is an amazing technique.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.380
You're too mean!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.220
Ha! I knew it!

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.460
Well, then, in that case...

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:46.910
I'll leave it to you!

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:48.220
H-Hey!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.370
You!

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:52.370
Hehehehe!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:55.000
Don't run away!

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.000
It's your fault, Dramata!

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.040
Uhehehe!
